  <Docs>
    <summary>Defines a callback that validates ZIP entry paths when they are accessed.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Install an implementation with <see cref="M:Dalvik.SystemInterop.ZipPathValidator.SetCallback(Dalvik.SystemInterop.ZipPathValidator.ICallback)" />. The default Android implementation accepts all entry paths.</para>
      <para>See the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/libcore/+/de876a01b29230b877c9f408348c38a90ee724a5/dalvik/src/main/java/dalvik/system/ZipPathValidator.java">Android ZipPathValidator.Callback source</a></format>.</para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
