      <Docs>
        <param name="path">The name of the ZIP entry to validate.</param>
        <summary>Checks whether a ZIP entry path is valid.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>Android calls this method when <see cref="P:Java.Util.Zip.ZipInputStream.NextEntry" /> reads an entry or a <see cref="T:Java.Util.Zip.ZipFile" /> is opened. An implementation can throw <see cref="T:Java.Util.Zip.ZipException" /> if the entry path is invalid under its validation rules. The default Android implementation accepts all paths without throwing an exception.</para>
          <para>See the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/libcore/+/de876a01b29230b877c9f408348c38a90ee724a5/dalvik/src/main/java/dalvik/system/ZipPathValidator.java">Android onZipEntryAccess source</a></format>.</para>
        </remarks>
